        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Hotham Alpine Resort, Mount Hotham, Charlotte Pass village, Melbourne, Sydney, Adelaide, New South Wales\n- Topics: resort altitude, road distance\n\nFacts:\n- Hotham Alpine Resort is set on the slopes of Mount Hotham.\n- Hotham Alpine Resort comprises an alpine village at an altitude of 1750 m.\n- Hotham Alpine Resort is the second highest resort village in Australia after Charlotte Pass village in New South Wales.\n- Mount Hotham is approximately 357 km northeast of Melbourne by road.\n- Mount Hotham is approximately 746 km from Sydney by road.\n- Mount Hotham is approximately 997 km from Adelaide by road.",
